  description: '2 "Myutant" monsters with different Attributes

    If this card
    is Fusion Summoned: You can target 1 card on the field; destroy it. When your
    opponent activates a card or effect (Quick Effect): You can activate this effect;
    for the rest of this turn, this face-up card is unaffected by the effects of
    an opponent''s cards of the same type (Monster, Spell, or Trap) as that card.
    If this Fusion Summoned card you control is destroyed by an opponent''s card:
    You can add 1 of your banished "Myutant" cards to your hand. You can only use
    each effect of "Myutant Synthesis" once per turn.'
